{"id":"6.1","title":"Hva gjorde du i går?","audio":"audio/6.1.mp3","duration":195.03,"synthetic":false,"sentences":[{"id":0,"start":0.15,"end":4.03,"text":"6.1 Hva gjorde du i går?","heading":true,"zh":"6.1 你昨天做了什么？","words":[[0,3,0.15,1.24,"6.1"],[4,7,2.4,2.66,"hva"],[8,14,2.66,3.06,"gjorde"],[15,17,3.06,3.28,"du"],[18,19,3.28,3.54,"i~6dd791e81ade"],[20,23,3.54,3.95,"går~19c0ec0c547b"]]},{"id":1,"start":6.95,"end":15.97,"text":"Viola er på besøk hos venninna Synne, og de sitter på rommet til Synne og hører på musikk.","zh":"维奥拉在朋友辛妮家做客，她们坐在辛妮的房间里听音乐。","words":[[0,5,7.03,7.61,"viola"],[6,8,7.61,8.07,"er"],[9,11,8.07,8.21,"på~0f89472b1dab"],[12,17,8.21,8.85,"besøk"],[18,21,8.85,9.45,"hos"],[22,30,9.45,10.05,"venninna"],[31,36,10.05,10.49,"synne"],[38,40,11.69,11.99,"og"],[41,43,11.99,12.23,"de"],[44,50,12.23,12.59,"sitter"],[51,53,12.59,12.89,"på"],[54,60,12.89,13.27,"rommet"],[61,64,13.27,13.41,"til~8de1a9181f86"],[65,70,13.41,13.87,"synne"],[71,73,13.87,14.61,"og"],[74,79,14.61,14.97,"hører"],[80,82,14.97,15.25,"på~33449e88ce8b"],[83,89,15.25,15.89,"musikk"]]},{"id":2,"start":17.19,"end":22.18,"text":"Synne snakker hele tida, men Viola sier ikke mye.","zh":"辛妮一直在说话，但维奥拉话不多。","words":[[0,5,17.27,17.76,"synne"],[6,13,17.76,18.32,"snakker"],[14,18,18.32,18.68,"hele"],[19,23,18.68,18.94,"tida"],[25,28,19.66,20.3,"men"],[29,34,20.3,20.98,"viola"],[35,39,20.98,21.4,"sier"],[40,44,21.4,21.66,"ikke"],[45,48,21.66,22.1,"mye~cc164d0dc3da"]]},{"id":3,"start":23.9,"end":27.16,"text":"Du er stille i dag. Er det noe i veien?","speaker":"Synne","zh":"你今天很安静。出什么事了吗？","words":[[0,2,23.98,24.1,"du"],[3,5,24.1,24.26,"er"],[6,12,24.26,24.72,"stille~f9f905f4076f"],[13,14,24.72,24.86,"i~de136e71704d"],[15,18,24.86,25.06,"dag"],[20,22,25.78,26.04,"er"],[23,26,26.04,26.14,"det"],[27,30,26.14,26.4,"noe"],[31,32,26.4,26.52,"i~cdc0a31b23df"],[33,38,26.52,27.08,"veien~9da0c02666a7"]]},{"id":4,"start":28.17,"end":31.68,"text":"Noe i veien? Hva betyr det?","speaker":"Viola","zh":"“Noe i veien”？这是什么意思？","words":[[0,3,28.25,28.64,"noe"],[4,5,28.64,28.82,"i~cdc0a31b23df"],[6,11,28.82,29.3,"veien~9da0c02666a7"],[13,16,30.06,30.46,"hva"],[17,22,30.46,31.14,"betyr"],[23,26,31.14,31.6,"det"]]},{"id":5,"start":32.4,"end":34.09,"text":"Har du en dårlig dag?","speaker":"Synne","zh":"你今天过得不好吗？","words":[[0,3,32.48,32.8,"har"],[4,6,32.8,32.9,"du"],[7,9,32.9,33.08,"en~a939a9e56dc5"],[10,16,33.08,33.44,"dårlig"],[17,20,33.44,34.01,"dag"]]},{"id":6,"start":34.28,"end":40.09,"text":"Ja, jeg er kjempetrøtt. Det var en travel dag i går.","speaker":"Viola","zh":"是的，我累坏了。昨天是忙碌的一天。","words":[[0,2,34.5,35.16,"ja"],[4,7,35.75,35.99,"jeg"],[8,10,35.99,36.21,"er"],[11,22,36.21,37.47,"kjempetrøtt"],[24,27,38.25,38.39,"det"],[28,31,38.39,38.51,"var"],[32,34,38.51,38.69,"en~a939a9e56dc5"],[35,41,38.69,39.23,"travel"],[42,45,39.23,39.49,"dag"],[46,47,39.49,39.65,"i~6dd791e81ade"],[48,51,39.65,40.01,"går~19c0ec0c547b"]]},{"id":7,"start":40.73,"end":41.51,"text":"Hvorfor det?","speaker":"Synne","zh":"为什么呢？","words":[[0,7,40.81,41.14,"hvorfor"],[8,11,41.14,41.43,"det"]]},{"id":8,"start":42.35,"end":49.97,"text":"Jeg hadde kjempemye å gjøre. Foreldrene var lenge på jobb, og jeg passet på de to guttene på to og fire år.","speaker":"Viola","zh":"我有一大堆事要做。孩子的父母上班时间很长，我照看那两个分别两岁和四岁的男孩。","words":[[0,3,42.43,42.56,"jeg"],[4,9,42.56,42.76,"hadde"],[10,19,42.76,43.6,"kjempemye~04f5b2dc4b3c"],[20,21,43.6,43.76,"å~0583da7a620a"],[22,27,43.76,43.94,"gjøre"],[29,39,45.11,45.67,"foreldrene"],[40,43,45.67,45.89,"var"],[44,49,45.89,46.17,"lenge"],[50,52,46.17,46.37,"på"],[53,57,46.37,46.87,"jobb"],[59,61,47.15,47.23,"og"],[62,65,47.23,47.35,"jeg"],[66,72,47.35,47.71,"passet~54963c9cd5f0"],[73,75,47.71,47.89,"på~88e395983d3f"],[76,78,47.89,48.05,"de~24943ca75398"],[79,81,48.05,48.19,"to"],[82,89,48.19,48.67,"guttene"],[90,92,48.67,48.81,"på~60f9e556b593"],[93,95,48.81,49.09,"to"],[96,98,49.09,49.21,"og"],[99,103,49.21,49.43,"fire"],[104,106,49.43,49.89,"år"]]},{"id":9,"start":50.22,"end":54.02,"text":"Jeg skjønner. Liker du å jobbe som au pair?","speaker":"Synne","zh":"我明白了。你喜欢当互惠生吗？","words":[[0,3,50.26,50.82,"jeg"],[4,12,50.82,51.26,"skjønner"],[14,19,51.9,52.36,"liker"],[20,22,52.36,52.56,"du"],[23,24,52.56,52.76,"å~0583da7a620a"],[25,30,52.76,53.02,"jobbe"],[31,34,53.02,53.24,"som~90f492b4f2ff"],[35,37,53.24,53.48,"au"],[38,42,53.48,53.94,"pair"]]},{"id":10,"start":54.33,"end":60.57,"text":"Ja, vanligvis liker jeg det veldig godt, men i går var det en veldig travel dag.","speaker":"Viola","zh":"喜欢，平时我非常喜欢，可是昨天真是特别忙的一天。","words":[[0,2,54.41,54.72,"ja"],[4,13,54.98,55.82,"vanligvis"],[14,19,55.82,56.3,"liker"],[20,23,56.3,56.4,"jeg"],[24,27,56.4,56.54,"det"],[28,34,56.54,56.98,"veldig"],[35,39,56.98,57.26,"godt~31386d5489ca"],[41,44,57.72,58.04,"men"],[45,46,58.04,58.18,"i~6dd791e81ade"],[47,50,58.18,58.4,"går~19c0ec0c547b"],[51,54,58.4,58.68,"var"],[55,58,58.68,58.82,"det"],[59,61,58.82,59.0,"en~a939a9e56dc5"],[62,68,59.0,59.7,"veldig"],[69,75,59.74,60.04,"travel"],[76,79,60.04,60.49,"dag"]]},{"id":11,"start":60.75,"end":62.58,"text":"Hva gjorde du i går?","speaker":"Synne","zh":"你昨天做了什么？","words":[[0,3,60.88,61.4,"hva"],[4,10,61.4,61.66,"gjorde"],[11,13,61.66,61.92,"du"],[14,15,61.92,62.06,"i~6dd791e81ade"],[16,19,62.06,62.5,"går~19c0ec0c547b"]]},{"id":12,"start":63.55,"end":83.0,"text":"Først laget jeg frokost og smurte matpakker til guttene. Så spiste vi, og jeg leverte guttene i barnehagen. Så var jeg på norskkurs i fem timer. Etter skolen dro jeg sammen med ei jente i klassen til biblioteket og gjorde lekser.","speaker":"Viola","zh":"我先做了早饭，给男孩们准备了便当。然后我们吃饭，我把男孩们送到了幼儿园。然后我上了五个小时的挪威语课。放学后，我和班上的一个女孩一起去图书馆写作业。","words":[[0,5,63.63,64.28,"først"],[6,11,64.28,64.74,"laget~8790a82fb4ba"],[12,15,64.74,64.84,"jeg"],[16,23,64.84,65.54,"frokost"],[24,26,65.54,65.82,"og"],[27,33,65.82,66.14,"smurte~ed4f61966ca1"],[34,43,66.14,66.78,"matpakker"],[44,47,66.78,67.04,"til"],[48,55,67.04,67.46,"guttene"],[57,59,68.42,69.2,"så~bfb333151d21"],[60,66,69.2,69.7,"spiste"],[67,69,69.7,69.94,"vi"],[71,73,70.56,70.74,"og"],[74,77,70.74,70.92,"jeg"],[78,85,70.92,71.32,"leverte"],[86,93,71.32,71.76,"guttene"],[94,95,71.76,71.9,"i"],[96,106,71.9,72.42,"barnehagen"],[108,110,73.5,74.0,"så~bfb333151d21"],[111,114,74.0,74.5,"var"],[115,118,74.5,74.64,"jeg"],[119,121,74.64,74.8,"på"],[122,131,74.8,75.34,"norskkurs"],[132,133,75.34,75.7,"i~23369603e073"],[134,137,75.7,75.96,"fem"],[138,143,75.96,76.34,"timer"],[145,150,77.41,77.75,"etter"],[151,157,77.75,78.23,"skolen"],[158,161,78.23,78.83,"dro"],[162,165,78.83,78.99,"jeg"],[166,172,78.99,79.37,"sammen"],[173,176,79.37,79.49,"med"],[177,179,79.49,79.67,"ei~47aa2d18e376"],[180,185,79.67,80.05,"jente"],[186,187,80.05,80.21,"i"],[188,195,80.21,80.65,"klassen"],[196,199,80.65,80.89,"til"],[200,211,80.89,81.93,"biblioteket"],[212,214,81.93,82.15,"og"],[215,221,82.15,82.31,"gjorde"],[222,228,82.31,82.92,"lekser"]]},{"id":13,"start":83.79,"end":92.28,"text":"Vi leste og pugget verb. Etterpå hentet jeg guttene i barnehagen klokka fire, og jeg laget middag.","speaker":"Viola","zh":"我们读书，背动词。之后我四点去幼儿园接男孩们，然后做了晚饭。","words":[[0,2,83.87,84.04,"vi"],[3,8,84.04,84.48,"leste"],[9,11,84.48,85.04,"og"],[12,18,85.04,85.34,"pugget"],[19,23,85.34,85.68,"verb"],[25,32,86.82,87.4,"etterpå"],[33,39,87.4,87.84,"hentet"],[40,43,87.84,87.94,"jeg"],[44,51,87.94,88.34,"guttene"],[52,53,88.34,88.48,"i"],[54,64,88.48,89.06,"barnehagen"],[65,71,89.06,89.44,"klokka"],[72,76,89.44,89.72,"fire"],[78,80,90.48,90.7,"og"],[81,84,90.7,90.82,"jeg"],[85,90,90.82,91.16,"laget~8790a82fb4ba"],[91,97,91.16,91.56,"middag"]]},{"id":14,"start":92.28,"end":94.67,"text":"Slappet du av om kvelden, da?","speaker":"Synne","zh":"那你晚上放松了吗？","words":[[0,7,92.44,93.16,"slappet"],[8,10,93.16,93.28,"du"],[11,13,93.28,93.54,"av~6aef60c561bf"],[14,16,93.54,93.82,"om~c13075d78f52"],[17,24,93.82,94.28,"kvelden"],[26,28,94.36,94.59,"da~2f57e24a4c85"]]},{"id":15,"start":95.06,"end":104.77,"text":"Nei. Guttene lekte og rotet, og jeg ryddet og vasket gulvet. Til slutt sovnet jeg på sofaen, for jeg var så trøtt.","speaker":"Viola","zh":"没有。男孩们又玩又闹，把东西弄得乱七八糟，我收拾屋子、擦地板。最后我在沙发上睡着了，因为我太累了。","words":[[0,3,95.14,95.6,"nei"],[5,12,96.4,97.02,"guttene"],[13,18,97.02,97.48,"lekte"],[19,21,97.48,97.68,"og"],[22,27,97.68,98.12,"rotet"],[29,31,98.46,98.56,"og"],[32,35,98.56,98.66,"jeg"],[36,42,98.66,99.02,"ryddet"],[43,45,99.02,99.22,"og"],[46,52,99.22,99.36,"vasket"],[53,59,99.49,99.93,"gulvet"],[61,64,100.24,101.0,"til~670533c5eb47"],[65,70,101.0,101.4,"slutt"],[71,77,101.4,102.08,"sovnet"],[78,81,102.08,102.22,"jeg"],[82,84,102.22,102.4,"på"],[85,91,102.4,102.94,"sofaen"],[93,96,103.26,103.36,"for~1b22712a94b1"],[97,100,103.36,103.5,"jeg"],[101,104,103.5,103.68,"var"],[105,107,103.68,104.0,"så~4cf7ace176d0"],[108,113,104.0,104.69,"trøtt"]]},{"id":16,"start":105.18,"end":110.08,"text":"Huff, det var en slitsom dag! Du trenger å slappe av i kveld.","speaker":"Synne","zh":"唉，真是累人的一天！你今晚需要好好放松一下。","words":[[0,4,105.26,105.68,"huff"],[6,9,106.28,106.44,"det"],[10,13,106.44,106.56,"var"],[14,16,106.56,106.74,"en~a939a9e56dc5"],[17,24,106.74,107.42,"slitsom"],[25,28,107.42,107.62,"dag"],[30,32,108.41,108.65,"du"],[33,40,108.65,108.95,"trenger"],[41,42,108.95,109.07,"å~0583da7a620a"],[43,49,109.07,109.29,"slappe~75bc27ca2f9a"],[50,52,109.29,109.55,"av~6aef60c561bf"],[53,54,109.55,109.73,"i~6e0a15a5aae1"],[55,60,109.73,110.0,"kveld"]]},{"id":17,"start":113.91,"end":115.02,"text":"Sammendrag","subheading":true,"zh":"内容概要","words":[[0,10,113.99,114.94,"sammendrag"]]},{"id":18,"start":116.52,"end":120.6,"text":"Viola hadde en travel dag i går og jobbet mye.","zh":"维奥拉昨天很忙，干了很多活。","words":[[0,5,116.6,117.23,"viola"],[6,11,117.23,117.51,"hadde"],[12,14,117.51,117.77,"en~a939a9e56dc5"],[15,21,117.85,118.27,"travel"],[22,25,118.27,118.55,"dag"],[26,27,118.55,118.75,"i~6dd791e81ade"],[28,31,118.75,118.95,"går~19c0ec0c547b"],[32,34,118.95,119.65,"og"],[35,41,119.65,120.03,"jobbet"],[42,45,120.03,120.52,"mye~933c5a923198"]]},{"id":19,"start":121.36,"end":126.37,"text":"Om morgenen laget hun frokost og leverte guttene i barnehagen.","zh":"早上她做了早饭，把男孩们送到了幼儿园。","words":[[0,2,121.44,121.61,"om~5b93c55d689f"],[3,11,121.61,122.25,"morgenen"],[12,17,122.25,122.69,"laget~8790a82fb4ba"],[18,21,122.69,122.83,"hun"],[22,29,122.83,123.53,"frokost"],[30,32,123.53,124.25,"og"],[33,40,124.25,124.73,"leverte"],[41,48,124.73,125.23,"guttene"],[49,50,125.23,125.49,"i"],[51,61,125.49,126.29,"barnehagen"]]},{"id":20,"start":127.45,"end":131.19,"text":"Etterpå var hun på norskkurs og på biblioteket.","zh":"之后她去上了挪威语课，又去了图书馆。","words":[[0,7,127.53,128.11,"etterpå"],[8,11,128.11,128.39,"var"],[12,15,128.39,128.59,"hun"],[16,18,128.59,128.79,"på"],[19,28,128.79,129.37,"norskkurs"],[29,31,129.37,130.09,"og"],[32,34,130.09,130.29,"på"],[35,46,130.29,131.11,"biblioteket"]]},{"id":21,"start":132.31,"end":136.34,"text":"Så hentet hun guttene i barnehagen og laget middag.","zh":"然后她去幼儿园接了男孩们，并做了晚饭。","words":[[0,2,132.39,132.73,"så~bfb333151d21"],[3,9,132.73,133.31,"hentet"],[10,13,133.31,133.45,"hun"],[14,21,133.45,133.93,"guttene"],[22,23,133.93,134.03,"i"],[24,34,134.03,134.63,"barnehagen"],[35,37,134.63,135.51,"og"],[38,43,135.51,135.81,"laget~8790a82fb4ba"],[44,50,135.81,136.26,"middag"]]},{"id":22,"start":137.48,"end":141.5,"text":"Viola ryddet huset, for guttene rotet mye.","zh":"维奥拉收拾了房子，因为男孩们弄得很乱。","words":[[0,5,137.56,138.29,"viola"],[6,12,138.29,138.67,"ryddet"],[13,18,138.67,139.23,"huset"],[20,23,139.77,139.97,"for~1b22712a94b1"],[24,31,139.97,140.43,"guttene"],[32,37,140.43,140.93,"rotet"],[38,41,140.93,141.42,"mye~933c5a923198"]]},{"id":23,"start":142.4,"end":145.7,"text":"Til slutt sovnet hun på sofaen.","zh":"最后她在沙发上睡着了。","words":[[0,3,142.48,142.76,"til~670533c5eb47"],[4,9,142.76,143.2,"slutt"],[10,16,143.2,144.28,"sovnet"],[17,20,144.28,144.5,"hun"],[21,23,144.5,145.0,"på"],[24,30,145.0,145.62,"sofaen"]]},{"id":24,"start":149.57,"end":150.27,"text":"Fakta","subheading":true,"zh":"小知识","words":[[0,5,149.65,150.19,"fakta"]]},{"id":25,"start":152.37,"end":153.74,"text":"På biblioteket","subheading":true,"zh":"在图书馆","words":[[0,2,152.45,152.58,"på"],[3,14,152.58,153.66,"biblioteket"]]},{"id":26,"start":154.69,"end":158.63,"text":"Det er mange bibliotek i Norge.","zh":"挪威有很多图书馆。","words":[[0,3,155.19,155.95,"det"],[4,6,155.95,156.25,"er"],[7,12,156.25,156.63,"mange"],[13,22,156.63,157.77,"bibliotek"],[23,24,157.77,158.07,"i"],[25,30,158.07,158.56,"norge~546b56e35dd5"]]},{"id":27,"start":160.0,"end":169.17,"text":"På biblioteket kan du låne bøker på mange forskjellige språk, lese aviser og bruke datamaskiner.","zh":"在图书馆，你可以借各种语言的书、看报纸、用电脑。","words":[[0,2,160.08,160.32,"på"],[3,14,160.32,161.68,"biblioteket"],[15,18,161.68,162.0,"kan"],[19,21,162.0,162.12,"du"],[22,26,162.12,162.4,"låne"],[27,32,162.4,162.92,"bøker"],[33,35,162.92,163.22,"på~28f277571376"],[36,41,163.22,163.64,"mange"],[42,54,163.64,164.28,"forskjellige"],[55,60,164.28,164.86,"språk"],[62,66,165.6,165.84,"lese"],[67,73,165.84,166.48,"aviser"],[74,76,166.48,167.62,"og"],[77,82,167.62,167.94,"bruke"],[83,95,167.94,169.09,"datamaskiner"]]},{"id":28,"start":170.72,"end":174.14,"text":"På biblioteket kan de hjelpe deg med å finne bøker.","zh":"在图书馆，工作人员可以帮你找书。","words":[[0,2,170.8,171.0,"på"],[3,14,171.0,172.06,"biblioteket"],[15,18,172.06,172.26,"kan"],[19,21,172.26,172.42,"de"],[22,28,172.42,172.82,"hjelpe"],[29,32,172.82,173.02,"deg"],[33,36,173.02,173.2,"med~41eec44f57d5"],[37,38,173.2,173.32,"å~0583da7a620a"],[39,44,173.32,173.56,"finne"],[45,50,173.56,174.06,"bøker"]]},{"id":29,"start":175.53,"end":183.8,"text":"Noen bibliotek har leksehjelp, språkkafé og andre tilbud til innvandrere.","zh":"有些图书馆为移民提供作业辅导、语言咖啡馆和其他服务。","words":[[0,4,175.6,176.07,"noen~c766e2ef794d"],[5,14,176.07,176.81,"bibliotek"],[15,18,176.81,177.67,"har"],[19,29,177.67,178.73,"leksehjelp"],[31,40,179.31,180.33,"språkkafé"],[41,43,180.33,181.35,"og"],[44,49,181.44,182.0,"andre~0c69ef1e750c"],[50,56,182.0,182.42,"tilbud"],[57,60,182.42,182.76,"til"],[61,72,182.76,183.72,"innvandrere"]]},{"id":30,"start":185.08,"end":191.47,"text":"I noen byer har biblioteket også temadager med aktiviteter for barn.","zh":"在一些城市，图书馆还举办有儿童活动的主题日。","words":[[0,1,185.16,185.33,"i"],[2,6,185.33,185.77,"noen~c766e2ef794d"],[7,11,185.77,186.21,"byer"],[12,15,186.21,186.89,"har"],[16,27,186.89,187.95,"biblioteket"],[28,32,187.95,188.33,"også"],[33,42,188.33,189.19,"temadager"],[43,46,189.19,189.83,"med~efc2be39e71f"],[47,58,189.83,190.71,"aktiviteter"],[59,62,190.71,190.95,"for~e03005f6eea8"],[63,67,190.95,191.39,"barn"]]}],"lexicon":{"6.1":{"lemma":"6.1","zh":"第 6.1 节","pos":"编号","ref":null,"clip":null,"kind":"section"},"aktiviteter":{"lemma":"aktivitet","zh":"活动","pos":"名词","ref":"5-111","form":"复数不定","clip":null},"andre":{"lemma":"andre","zh":"其他的；别的（annen 的复数）；第二","pos":"代词／序数词","ref":"basics:ordinals:andre","clip":"pronunciation/bd01b0b648c2c64eb1bd.mp3","ambiguous":true,"candidates":[{"lemma":"andre","zh":"其他的；别的（annen 的复数）；第二","pos":"代词／序数词","ref":"basics:ordinals:andre"},{"lemma":"andre","zh":"第二","pos":"序数词","ref":"basics:ordinals:andre"},{"lemma":"annen","zh":"其他","pos":"形容词","ref":"11-037","form":"变化形式"}]},"au":{"lemma":"au pair","zh":"（au pair）互惠生","pos":"名词","ref":null,"clip":null},"av":{"lemma":"av","zh":"……的；从；由","pos":"介词","ref":"pa-vei-3-029","clip":"pronunciation/27a26bca625b22397190.mp3"},"aviser":{"lemma":"avis","zh":"报纸","pos":"名词","ref":"6-036","form":"复数不定","clip":null},"barn":{"lemma":"barn","zh":"孩子","pos":"名词","ref":"2-051","clip":"pronunciation/e43a7ece3a362be44a9e.mp3"},"barnehagen":{"lemma":"barnehage","zh":"幼儿园","pos":"名词","ref":"2-044","form":"单数定指","clip":null},"besøk":{"lemma":"besøk","zh":"拜访；做客","pos":"名词","ref":"6-001","clip":"pronunciation/5483e4d5c37230c6a429.mp3"},"betyr":{"lemma":"bety","zh":"意思是；意味着（bety 的现在时）","pos":"动词","form":"现在时","ref":null,"clip":"pronunciation/52f56f7728b57f1a5345.mp3"},"bibliotek":{"lemma":"bibliotek","zh":"图书馆","pos":"名词","ref":"basics:city:bibliotek","clip":"pronunciation/8